# Professional Real Estate Website – WordPress + Astra + Elementor

## Project Objective

Build a fully functional, professional real-estate website locally using:

- WordPress
- Astra Theme
- Elementor / Elementor Pro where required
- WordPress database
- Responsive design
- HTML5
- CSS3
- JavaScript where required
- PHP/WordPress functionality where required

The website must be designed as a professional real-estate business website that can later be migrated from the local development environment to a live hosting server.

The website should not look like a simple WordPress template. It should have a modern, premium, trustworthy real-estate-company appearance.

---

