# 23. Local Development Architecture

Develop the website locally first.

Recommended structure:

WordPress
│
├── wp-admin
├── wp-content
│ ├── themes
│ │ └── astra
│ ├── plugins
│ └── uploads
│
└── wp-includes

Use Astra as the WordPress theme.

Use Elementor for page construction.

Keep custom functionality separated from Elementor wherever practical.

Do not place major custom PHP functionality directly into Astra's parent theme.

If custom PHP functionality is required, use a child theme or a custom plugin.

