# Important Development Rule

Build this as a **real production-ready architecture**, not merely a visual Elementor mockup.

Use Elementor for visual/page-building work.

Use WordPress/Astra for the website framework.

Use plugins or custom WordPress functionality for dynamic features.

Keep custom code organized and maintainable.

The final project should be suitable for later deployment to a real domain and hosting server.

At every stage, explain:

1. What is being created
2. Why it is required
3. Which WordPress/Astra/Elementor component is being used
4. Where the files are located
5. How the component works
6. How to test it locally

The goal is not only to create the website but also to teach the developer how a professional WordPress + Astra + Elementor project is structured.
